# The impeccable hook's per-session cache — machine-generated, rewritten on
# every edit, and keyed by session id with absolute paths inside. It has no
# reader outside the tool that writes it, and tracking it meant a routine
# `git add -A` swept it into a feature PR (#155). `.impeccable/config.json`
# is real configuration and stays tracked.
.impeccable/hook.cache.json

# Brainstorming visual companion (superpowers)
.superpowers/

# Superpowers plans and specs — working notes for one story at one moment,
# not a record the repo maintains. They go stale the day their story ships
# (paths that have since moved, links to a stories/ tree that no longer
# exists), and a reader cannot tell which are current. What survives a story
# belongs in AGENTS.md, the deep-dive docs, or the commit that shipped it.
# Everything committed up to this point stays in history.
docs/superpowers/
